From 8943fed0d370e2aab1243d217696959cb89ef9e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilko Iliev <iliev@ronetix.at>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 13:55:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arch: dts: sama5d3xcm.dtsi: use rgmii-id phy-mode for the
 KSZ9131 GMAC PHY

U-Boot vendors two parallel, independently-built device-tree sources
for this board:

  - dts/upstream/src/arm/microchip/  -- a newer tree kept in sync with
    the Linux kernel's arch/arm/boot/dts layout, used only when
    CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM is selected.
  - arch/arm/dts/                    -- an older, U-Boot-only tree with
    its own board files (sama5d36ek.dts -> sama5d3xmb.dtsi ->
    sama5d3xcm.dtsi), used when CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM is *not* selected.

sama5d3xek_nandflash_defconfig (CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="sama5d36ek")
does not select CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM, so it is the legacy arch/arm/dts/
tree that actually gets compiled into the U-Boot binary -- confirmed by
the presence of the .dtb/.cmd build artifacts under arch/arm/dts/ and
their absence under dts/upstream/.

This applies the identical, hardware-verified fix already carried on
the kernel side (see the Linux kernel patch of the same name) to the
KSZ9131 GMAC PHY on this board's macb0: the stock phy-mode = "rgmii"
plus *-skew-ps properties are specific to the original KSZ9021 PHY
binding and are not read by the KSZ9131 driver at all, which instead
needs phy-mode = "rgmii-id" to enable its own internal RX+TX delay
lines (this board has no external PCB delay compensation, RC-only PHY
reset). Confirmed on real hardware: tftp at the U-Boot prompt now
completes cleanly at link up, 1000Mbps full-duplex.

Signed-off-by: Ilko Iliev <iliev@ronetix.at>
---
 arch/arm/dts/sama5d3xcm.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sama5d3xcm.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sama5d3xcm.dtsi
index d123057f30..8493a25be1 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/sama5d3xcm.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sama5d3xcm.dtsi
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@
 			};
 
 			macb0: ethernet@f0028000 {
-				phy-mode = "rgmii";
+				phy-mode = "rgmii-id";
 				#address-cells = <1>;
 				#size-cells = <0>;
 
-- 
2.43.0

